      "writtenOn": "2024-12-03T19:40:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, I meant that `apex_available` property of **`framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar`** is a no-op. `framework-connectivity-b` is statically included in `com.android.tethering-bootclasspath-fragment`, thus is part of an apex and `apex_available` property is required.\n\n`framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar` is considered to be included in the system partition because it does not belong to any apexes, as mentioned above.",
      "parentUuid": "33cea7b1_29239527",
      "revId": "ce544f725b16ec51e849fabb333cbf55ee186d87",
